            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Anomalies: each label has a recognisable signature",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "A1   ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Fat-finger payments are far more often ≈32× or more away from the typical amount (rounded order of magnitude ≥ 2: 72.0% vs 9.7%); an exact ×10^k multiplier is not established",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "   [Supported]",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "color": "#605E5C"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "A2 / A2b   ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Duplicates come in bursts of 2–5 identical payments (same sender, payee, currency and amount) about 18 min apart; no evidence of unlabelled originals: an earlier unlabelled match occurs for 9.2% of bursts, the same as the chance rate (9.2%). Same pattern for B and C senders",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "   [Supported]",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "color": "#605E5C"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "A3 / A4   ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Romance: same consumer pair, several payments within a day, rising amounts (98.8% vs 50.4% of C2C pairs with 3+ payments). CEO: business sender, first-time payee, above-usual amount",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "   [Supported]",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "color": "#605E5C"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "A5 / A6 / A7   ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Account replacement: mechanism not recovered. CUSTOMER_RECALL: 314 of 317 have no matching earlier payment (tested criteria). Rates differ by segment",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "   [A5 Inconclusive · A6 Confirmed · A7 Approximate]",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "color": "#605E5C"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
